<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USX-U.S. Steel raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USX-U.S. Steel raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Richard Aldrich said he upgraded USX-U.S. Steel Group to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- declined other comment.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/8 to 28-5/8.</p>
